Category:
Database

Affected Service:
Billing Platform

Impact:
Invoice creation failed for 7 minutes during unplanned SQL failover; 312 requests returned HTTP 500 and were retried by clients.

Root Cause (System Generated):
Hardware fault on the primary SQL replica node triggered automatic failover; connections erred until the secondary was promoted.

Recommendation:
- Enable retry-with-backoff on all Billing API database calls.
- Shorten connection timeout to fail fast during failover windows.
- Subscribe to Azure Resource Health alerts for sqldb-billing-prod.
- Review zone-redundant configuration for the billing database tier.

Incident Status:
Mitigated

